# MAJOR CAMPUS REDESIGN AND GAMEPLAY FIXES — TERRASKILLS 3D CAMPUS

## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

I want you to undertake a major redesign of the existing TerraSkills 3D campus environment and fix the underlying gameplay, navigation, collision, transportation, and building-interaction systems.

The current environment looks scattered, poorly organized, and insufficiently realistic. Buildings, roads, vehicles, NPCs, and environmental features do not interact correctly. Several issues have been present since the earliest prompts, particularly the unrealistic transportation system and the failure of NPCs and vehicles to respect the environment.

**This is not merely a visual redesign. It is a structural and functional improvement to the existing game.**

Before making changes, inspect the existing project, understand its architecture, identify the systems responsible for the problems described below, and implement the fixes within the current codebase.

Do not rebuild the entire project from scratch, discard existing features, or replace functional systems unnecessarily. Preserve the existing gameplay, player progression, characters, interactions, and other working features while improving the campus and the systems that control it.

Do not simply add visual objects or simulate functionality with animations that are disconnected from the actual game logic. Every feature must work within the existing game.

